{"words": [{"text": "فَوَيْلٌۭ", "translation": "So woe"}, {"text": "لِّلَّذِينَ", "translation": "to those who"}, {"text": "يَكْتُبُونَ", "translation": "write"}, {"text": "ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ", "translation": "the book"}, {"text": "بِأَيْدِيهِمْ", "translation": "with their (own) hands"}, {"text": "ثُمَّ", "translation": "then"}, {"text": "يَقُولُونَ", "translation": "they say"}, {"text": "هَـٰذَا", "translation": "This"}, {"text": "مِنْ", "translation": "(is)"}, {"text": "عِندِ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "لِيَشْتَرُوا۟", "translation": "to barter"}, {"text": "بِهِۦ", "translation": "with it"}, {"text": "ثَمَنًۭا", "translation": "(for) a price"}, {"text": "قَلِيلًۭا ۖ", "translation": "little"}, {"text": "فَوَيْلٌۭ", "translation": "So woe"}, {"text": "لَّهُم", "translation": "to them"}, {"text": "مِّمَّا", "translation": "for what"}, {"text": "كَتَبَتْ", "translation": "have written"}, {"text": "أَيْدِيهِمْ", "translation": "their hands"}, {"text": "وَوَيْلٌۭ", "translation": "and woe"}, {"text": "لَّهُم", "translation": "to them"}, {"text": "مِّمَّا", "translation": "for what"}, {"text": "يَكْسِبُونَ", "translation": "they earn"}], "sahih": "So woe1 to those who write the \"scripture\" with their own hands, then say, \"This is from Allāh,\" in order to exchange it for a small price. Woe to them for what their hands have written and woe to them for what they earn."}